// ============================================================================
//  btnTestRole.OnSelect  —  DIAGNOSTIC ONLY (remove the button before shipping).
//
//  You're a Guest/spectator because your email isn't matched in any crew (and if
//  member 'User Email' values are blank, NOBODY matches by email). So this
//  impersonates a crew by NAME, not by email: it sets varTestCrew and re-runs the
//  dashboard's OnVisible (via the loading screen), which then features that crew's
//  top member. It doesn't recompute state itself, so it can't half-break the UI.
//
//  Each tap CYCLES:  Guest (real you) -> crew #1 -> crew #2 -> ... -> crew #N
//  -> back to Guest.  Brief splash on each tap while OnVisible re-runs.
//
//  REQUIRES (both already added):
//   - App.OnStart:        Set( varTestCrew, "" )      // "" not Blank(), so it has a Text type
//   - scrDashboard.OnVisible step 3: the varTestActive / varTestMember override block
//
//  PLACEMENT: a Button on scrDashboard (e.g. on the ribbon). Suggested Text:
//     "Test view: " & If( varRole = "spectator", "Guest (real you)",
//                          varDispName & " (" & varMyCrew & ")" )
// ============================================================================

// cycle the crew to impersonate by rank (0 = the real you) -------------------
Set( varTestIdx, Mod( Coalesce( varTestIdx, 0 ) + 1, CountRows( colCrew ) + 1 ) );
Set( varTestCrew, If( varTestIdx = 0, "", LookUp( colCrew, Rank = varTestIdx ).Crew ) );

// re-run the dashboard build with that identity ------------------------------
//   Bounce through the loading screen; its timer re-enters scrDashboard, whose
//   OnVisible applies the override. (If the timer is slow in your visual, the
//   loading screen's "View dashboard" button does the same thing.)
Navigate( scrLoading )

// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  TEST THE SPONSOR VIEW: the override always sets role = "member". To preview
//  the sponsor layout, temporarily change the OnVisible override block to set
//  varRole = "sponsor" (and varSponsorRec = varTestMember) while varTestActive.
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
